            "title": "國際｜印尼萬丹省糖果廠大火 現場整理出24個屍袋 約30人失蹤",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜印尼萬丹省糖果廠大火 現場整理出24個屍袋 約30人失蹤\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/616f0ec9de9bd5e8d7347b61a0073cd0f87aa623da92ff7e3eadbb2565717b9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜印尼萬丹省糖果廠大火 現場整理出24個屍袋 約30人失蹤</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">印尼萬丹省一間糖果廠於周六晚發生火災，警方表示救援人員已從現場整理出24個屍袋，另有約30人仍然下落不明。火勢尚未完全撲滅，警方計劃今日上午恢復搜救，但廠房部分結構有倒塌風險，加上現場仍有餘火，救援工作受阻。警方指遇難者遺骸無法憑外觀辨認，具體死亡人數未能確認，正採集失蹤者家屬的DNA樣本協助鑒定，預計需時兩至三周。廠方表示事發時約有300人在場，起火原因仍有待調查。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
