            "title": "科技｜英偉達AI芯片疑經灰色網絡流入內地 涉黃樂與太子集團胡小偉",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"科技｜英偉達AI芯片疑經灰色網絡流入內地 涉黃樂與太子集團胡小偉\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/616f0ec9de9bd5e8d7347b61a0073cd0f87aa623da92ff7e3eadbb2565717b9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">科技｜英偉達AI芯片疑經灰色網絡流入內地 涉黃樂與太子集團胡小偉</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">有報道指，總值數十億美元的灰色供應鏈把英偉達（Nvidia）先進人工智能芯片偷運至中國內地，牽涉與黃仁勳傳出緋聞的女商人黃樂、中國遊戲巨頭世紀華通、東南亞雲端商Megaspeed及柬埔寨太子集團。該網絡藉浪潮旗下加州子公司Aivres取得芯片，再把客戶包裝成東南亞雲端商，Megaspeed馬來西亞子公司一年內進口46億美元芯片，印尼警方今年初搜查時發現機架內並無GPU。英偉達稱2025年已把Megaspeed列入黑名單，太子集團否認美方指控。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-05b0bcc5-a5cf-3615-b1ce-cfc5fa4c998a-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-