            "title": "加密貨幣失寵 昔日支持者加速認賠出場",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/06d7c454d16442844d60427b67e7a3872ad8bcd5b276f3baa9ae5097857c39a9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd89ec956a5cc38da20689cb67a59a963.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8A%A0%E5%AF%86%E8%B2%A8%E5%B9%A3%E5%A4%B1%E5%AF%B5-%E6%98%94%E6%97%A5%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E8%80%85%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E8%AA%8D%E8%B3%A0%E5%87%BA%E5%A0%B4-142003617.html",
